Hello Survivors!

News and changes:[list]
[*] optimization - we managed to reduce sudden drops fps. This improved making gameplay more pleasant. It's not the only and last improvement. Next steps in future updates;
[*] from now anvil is part of the forge equipment. You can't build it separately anymore;
[*] pot - new tool. Useful to cook some food. You can craft this in forge;
[*] new soups (x6), goulash (x5) and recipes for them. It's good to cook soups and goulashes, because after preparation the ready dish receives only the strongest allergen. For example if you have allergy on carrot maybe you can eat carrot in soups and goulashes. It's depends which allergen is the mostly occurs in the dish;
[*] changed some craftings needs.
[/list]

New constructs elements:[list]
[*] 3x wall concrete and brick;
[*] 2x door wall concrete and brick;
[*] 2x window wall concrete and brick;
[*] 1x wood floor.
[/list]

New fruits and vegetables:[list]
[*] cherry, lemon, strawberry;
[*] bean, beetroot, asparagus, broccoli, cabbage, chilli, eggplant, lettuce, pumpkin, pumpkin italian, squash butternut, squash delicata.
[/list]

Right now we are starting work on a next big update. There will be many changes and news!

Stay tuned for next update!

Hello Survivors!

as we have already mentioned we have for you big update with extra stuff and many changes. In this update we focused on added new items. Also we decided to edit and expand the map for new places. You have to check it out! Now in a lower price.

News:[list]
[*] bigger map with new location like a small military base, village, new ponds, church, wild beach and more;
[*] from now when you get the materials you don't have to bend down to pick up (from example wood after cutting down a tree). Items immediately end up in your inventory. With one exception. If you have full inventory items appear on the ground as before.
[*] new notification from the right side of the screen about the amount acquired and raised items from the ground;
[*] scrap function in item menu. Now you can try scrap some item from your equipment (ex. glass jar and broken glass give you glass shards, empty can give you scrap metal);
[*] new look for vegetables and fruits;
[*] new icon items for fruits, vegetables, materials, tools, construct.
[/list]

New Material Items:[list]
[*] Coal (form coal boulder);
[*] Iron (metal scrap + clay in the forge);
[*] Glass Shards (after scrap some glass);
[*] Empty Glass Bottle (after drink whisky);
[*] Empty Plastic Bottle (after drink water bottle).
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33508794/c1ea4cb91bbce128950eab5a982f172345d3e1c7.png[/img]

New Concrete Construct:[list]
[*] 1x foundation;
[*] 3x wall;
[*] 4x door wall;
[*] 2x window wall;
[*] 2x glass;
[*] 1x stairs;
[*] 1x floor;
[*] 1x roof.
[/list]

New Tools:[list]
[*] Forge (Clay + Small Stone);
[*] New Simple Hammer - previous Hammer change name to Claw Hammer;
[*] Stone Axe - easy to craft for first primitive tools. Previous Axe is now Iron Axe.
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33508794/2b5d8f5a67f6198bb012103267b33487a9030e14.png[/img]

New Plant:[list]
[*] Mushrooms (toadstool, champignon, boletus);
[*] Flowers (goldenrod, hibiscus, clitoria ternatea).
[/list]

New Fruit:[list]
[*] Plum;
[*] Peach;
[*] Orange;
[*] Apircot.
[/list]

New Vegetables:[list]
[*] Potato;
[*] Onion;
[*] Pepper.
[/list]

New ground item (find and pick up from the ground):[list]
[*] Stick;
[*] Stone.
[/list]

New item sound for brick, glass shards, coal, wood stick and fruits.

Changes in crafting. Now items below move to craft in the Forge:[list]
[*] Brick;
[*] Galss Jar;
[*] Axe;
[*] PickAxe;
[*] Anvil;
[*] Bucket.
[/list]

Bugs:[list]
[*] Problem with collision tent, and workbench;
[*] Not enough space for description text of item;
[*] The description of the weapon contains incorrect information about the skill of the item;
[*] Schematic cause some error with campfire.
[/list]

Take care and have fun!

Hello Survivors,

we came to the end of Q1. Now we can prepare to start working on tasks fom Q2 which will be more intensive than Q1. So good luck to us :) and let's see what we have for you today!

News:[list]
[*] added new zombies - Doctor and Nurse. You can find them in the city near the hospital.
[/list]

Changes:[list]
[*] zombie pathfinder was improved. From now zombies move are more efficiently among various obstacles and buildings;
[*] "green" environment was changed (area around Farmland and Apocalypse City). Now terrain is more diverse. Added new trees, rocks, buildings, pond, camp and other details;
[*] rocks - from now rocks are consumed. You will have to travel to get more stone.
[*] clay drop rate now is bigger;
[*] dialogue and quest system (Three different quest panel and New shortcut "V" - open available quest). Still in progress, not ready to full use;
[*] balanced zombie loot drop rate.
[/list]

Small bug fixed:[list]
[*] road near the farm;
[*] some terrain have problem with placing constructions;
[*] fixed ladder on the windmill;
[*] save folder have wrong name.
[/list]

Stay tuned for next update!

Ho ho ho Survivors,

christmas is coming to Allergenium World! Somewhere near the city appeared a magical forest. Go find it. Have you been good this year? Maybe Santa Claus has something for you!

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33508794/fd8fa7a41650ece92db02572113ea0fcbbc9e07b.png[/img]

Christmas update:[list]
[*] new place to visit and explore - magical forest;
[*] new zombie - Santa;
[*] Santa's outfit - kill Santa zombie and get the special costume;
[*] Santa's gift - hit and take. You can get useful stuff;
[*] feel the magic of Christmas! Every time when you log in to the game the gifts are respawn in the same place.
[/list]
Changes:[list]
[*] Mr Bum Man - face lifting;
[*] Sylwana Forest and Giorgio Ravioli - face lifting.
[/list]
Bug fixes:[list]
[*] Sylwana Forest and Paul Goldman - now you can see correctly what you wearing;
[*] fixed minor bugs.
[/list]

Christmas is the most magical time of year, so we would like to wish every one of you happy holidays! Have fun with Christmas event and see you in coming year!:)

Hello Survivors,

schematics are now available. They work similarly like a recipes. From now some items will require a schematic to craft. On the map you can find one of them: flashlight. In the future will be created much more. 

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33508794/6695a2261100a040bd036a0a8b1b35b59eeaa83a.png[/img]

New items:[list]
[*] flashlight;
[*] battery;
[*] screwdriver;
[*] duct tape;
[*] light bulb;
[*] scrap electronics.
[/list]
New schematic:[list]
[*] flashlight.
[/list]
New crafting method:[list]
[*] ScrewDriver = ScrapMetal*3 (Knowledge 5 required);
[*]Bulb Light = Broken Glass + Scrap Eletronic (Knowledge 10 required);
[*] Flashlight = ScrewDriver + ScrapMetal + Duct Tape + Light Bulb + Scrap Eletronic + Battery (Schematic & Knowledge 10 required).
[/list]
When your battery off you must find another and click R just like reload the weapon.

Stay tuned for next update!

Hello Survivors,

the Allergenium world increases for next place to visit and more zombies!

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33508794/cdd1d30147395ca0095dfe23fd7cc2f913e70524.png[/img]
Meet the three different zombies: Sewer Worker (lazy and slow underground worker), Furious Man (very angry, very fast!) and Street Man.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33508794/d524ed623e142b76dac5cbfb85cabd42b5994dbf.png[/img]
New place to visit and explore! Find the sewer hatch and see what is hidding in the city's underground.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33508794/ef784170085fbf8a80d51f4eaf45de927a831bc8.png[/img]
Two new items.

Changes:[list]
[*] allergic system - name of allergy is no longer visible in description consumables items;
[*] added keyboard shortcut - Q (free hand);
[*] now you can get to hand the item faster. Just double click in equipment;
[*] also you can faster remove item from the hotbar. Just double click on it;
[*] axe, hammer, pickaxe and sledgehammer - using these tools now is more pleasure. Just hold down the mouse button for continuous work;
[*] now every canned drink after use will give the can back;
[*] now night is a little bit more brighter;
[*] edit scrap metal recipe - now you don't need the hammer to craft scrap metal from empty can. 
[/list]

Bug fixed:[list]
[*] some cars had a problem with searching;
[*] now achievement properly show stats on Steam.
[/list]

Stay tuned for next update!

Hello Survivors,

new update is ready to download.

New stuff:[list]
[*] sleeping bag -  now when you die you have new respawn point (you can find it in interiors or campsite);
[*] coffee beans - use it to prepare delicious coffee. Stored in paper bag (you can find it in campsite or "dinner" interior);
[*] rooibos flower - plant. Use it to prepare healthy tea. It grows in various places on the map;
[*] machete - new melee weapon.
[/list]
[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33508794/d648035c480a8725754f922d9d67d1889747cb6f.png[/img]

Crafting recipes:[list]
[*] coffee jar (campfire = coffee beans + water jar);
[*] red tea jar (campfire = rooibos flower + water jar);
[*] glass jar - (broken glass + metal).
[/list]

Changes:[list]
[*] sand is now bucket of sand (you can find it on various places on the map, use bucket to fill them);
[*] zombies - added new moving style. Also some of them move faster and has a larger range of vision;
[*] survivors - smoother walking. Better experience in walking on uneven surfaces like a sidewalk, holes, junk;
[*] better aspect for high and low resolution screen that 1920x1080.
[/list]
Bug fixes:[list]
[*] some tenth have problem with searching - now this shouldn't happen;
[*] cooking on campfire didn't work properly. There appear random bugs when you want to cook something. Resolved by creating new campfire system;
[*] improved drop spawn rocks, wood and metal.
[/list]
Some content like coffee beans or fix bug with campfire we added faster, during last week.

Also we want invite everyone to visit our forum on Steam. Feel free to make suggestions and comments. We will be gratefull for your feedback!

Stay tuned for next update!

Hello Survivors,

we are glad to inform you, that the Allergenium is available in the Steam store now :)

Before the release we have added a new patch, where:
[list]
[*] improve fire, water and explosion effect;
[*] add more details on the map;
[*] improve the code;
[*] refine some of the achievements.
[/list]
Have fun and stay tuned for next update!

Hello Survivors,

in this week our attention was focused mostly on the map. It has been extended for another forest areas and power station. Also we added new respawn places for zombies.

More news:[list]
[*] new food - banana;
[*] new material - broken glass (useful in future update);
[*] two melee weapon - broken bottle and nail plank;
[*] two new zombies - pilot and tourist;
[*] tree with apple;
[*] two new stuff -  antibiotics (when you take them, then your allergic immunity getting better!) and vitamins (can improve your health);
[*] edit recipe crafting;
[*] fixed small bugs.
[/list]
Moreover we changed searching system. Now found items are more diverse. 

Finally, the Allergenium in alpha version will be available on this Friday, 26 October. 

See you at the game and stay tuned for next update!

Hello Survivors,

next week, next update, new challenges! Let's see what new we have for you:

#Changes:
[list]
[*] added 43 new achievements (now is 53 to gain);
[*] new stuff - anvil. Needed to create advanced things;
[*] new muzzle flash effect on weapon;
